                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A record # of MDers got health coverage this year\u2014incl. many from historically underinsured populations. We successfully lowered premiums in the Inflation Reduction Act to make health care under the ACA even more affordable. Zero Rs voted for it\u2014but MDers are seeing the benefits.",
