                "text": "These reduced prices will be life-changing for patients & our economy \u2014 saving Medicare recipients $1.5 billion in out-of-pocket costs, while saving Medicare $6 billion in the first year alone.\n\nWe fought for this for decades. With the Inflation Reduction Act, we got it done.",
