                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We've worked to make health care through the ACA more affordable\u2014allowing more Americans than ever to get covered. But if Republicans allow those savings to expire next year, millions will lose their coverage.\n\nIt would be a nightmare for working families. https://t.co/f20bHGWi9R",
