                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare coverage for telehealth is set to expire on 12/31 \u2014\u00a0increasing barriers to care for those who depend on telehealth, including seniors, people w/ disabilities & underserved communities.\n\nWe're fighting to extend this coverage so no one loses access to the care they need.",
