                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The ACA's preventative care coverage saves lives AND prevents costly medical bills down the road.\n\u00a0\nThe Supreme Court should throw out the\u00a0far-right\u00a0lower court's legally flawed ruling and ensure Americans don't lose access to critical preventative care. https://t.co/eNMvrEpVWc",
